      "scope": "trial_manager.py 361-365; benchmark.py 338-340",
      "deduction": "Named-verdict remeasurement without a ratio clears an earlier ratio. Ratio omission alone can leave it because UNSPECIFIED is discarded before persistence. This was not executed as a failure."
